<group prefix="WebGpuSharp.">
	<comment location="ShaderStage">
		<summary>
			Describes the shader stages that a binding will be visible from.
			These can be combined so something that is visible from both vertex and fragment shaders can be defined as:
			<see cref= "WebGpuSharp.ShaderStage.Vertex"/> | <see cref= "WebGpuSharp.ShaderStage.Fragment"/> 
		</summary>
	</comment>
	<group prefix="ShaderStage.">
		<comment location="None">
			<summary>Binding is not visible from any shader stage.</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="Vertex">
			<summary>Binding is visible from the vertex shader of a render pipeline.</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="Fragment">
			<summary>Binding is visible from the fragment shader of a render pipeline.</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="Compute">
			<summary>Binding is visible from the compute shader of a compute pipeline.</summary>
		</comment>
	</group>
</group>